#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:22
msgid "Restaurar · Importa un ZIP para restaurar tu sitio"
msgstr "Restore · Import a ZIP to restore your site"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:28
msgid "⚠ Advertencia:"
msgstr "⚠ Warning:"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:29
msgid ""
"La restauración sobrescribirá el contenido actual del sitio. Se creará un "
"respaldo automático previo a la restauración."
msgstr ""
"The restore will overwrite the current site content. An automatic backup "
"will be created before the restore."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:36
msgid "Cómo restaurar tu sitio"
msgstr "How to restore your site"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:43
msgid "Obtén el archivo .zip de respaldo"
msgstr "Get the backup .zip file"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:44
msgid ""
"Ve a la página Respaldos, selecciona el respaldo que deseas utilizar y "
"descárgalo. El archivo debe haber sido generado por este plugin y tiene "
"extensión .zip."
msgstr ""
"Go to the Backups page, select the backup you want to use, and download it. "
"The file must have been generated by this plugin and has the .zip extension."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:50
msgid "Selecciona el archivo en el formulario"
msgstr "Select the file in the form"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:51
msgid ""
"Haz clic en el campo de archivo de abajo y elige el .zip desde tu equipo. El "
"tamaño máximo permitido es el configurado en tu servidor."
msgstr ""
"Click the file field below and choose the .zip from your computer. The "
"maximum allowed size is set by your server."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:57
msgid "Inicia la restauración"
msgstr "Start the restore"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:58
msgid ""
"Pulsa \"Subir y restaurar\". Antes de sobrescribir cualquier dato, el plugin "
"creará automáticamente un respaldo de seguridad del estado actual del sitio."
msgstr ""
"Click \"Upload and restore\". Before overwriting any data, the plugin will "
"automatically create a safety backup of the current site state."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:64
msgid "Espera a que finalice el proceso"
msgstr "Wait for the process to finish"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:65
msgid ""
"La barra de progreso mostrará el avance. Al terminar, se cerrarán todas las "
"sesiones activas por seguridad y deberás volver a iniciar sesión."
msgstr ""
"The progress bar will show the progress. When done, all active sessions will "
"be closed for security and you will need to log in again."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:71
msgid "Requisitos del archivo:"
msgstr "File requirements:"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:73
msgid "Extensión .zip generado por Super Sheep Copy"
msgstr ".zip file generated by Super Sheep Copy"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:74
msgid "Debe contener manifest.json válido en su interior"
msgstr "Must contain a valid manifest.json inside"

#. translators: %s: max upload size
#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:80
#, php-format
msgid "Peso máximo: %s (límite del servidor)"
msgstr "Maximum size: %s (server limit)"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:98
msgid "Subir via FTP o panel de hosting"
msgstr "Upload via FTP or hosting panel"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:102
msgid ""
"Si el archivo es demasiado grande para subirlo desde el navegador, puedes "
"cargarlo directamente al servidor usando un cliente FTP (FileZilla, "
"Cyberduck) o el administrador de archivos de tu hosting (cPanel, Plesk, "
"DirectAdmin)."
msgstr ""
"If the file is too large to upload from the browser, you can upload it "
"directly to the server using an FTP client (FileZilla, Cyberduck) or your "
"hosting file manager (cPanel, Plesk, DirectAdmin)."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:109
msgid "Conéctate al servidor"
msgstr "Connect to the server"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:110
msgid ""
"Abre tu cliente FTP o el administrador de archivos de tu panel de hosting e "
"inicia sesión con tus credenciales."
msgstr ""
"Open your FTP client or hosting panel file manager and log in with your "
"credentials."

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:116
msgid "Navega a la carpeta de respaldos"
msgstr "Navigate to the backups folder"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:117
msgid ""
"Dirígete a la carpeta donde el plugin almacena los respaldos. A continuación "
"se muestran las rutas de tu instalación:"
msgstr ""
"Go to the folder where the plugin stores backups. The paths for your "
"installation are shown below:"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:120
msgid "Ruta absoluta (servidor):"
msgstr "Absolute path (server):"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:124
msgid "Ruta relativa (desde la raíz de WordPress):"
msgstr "Relative path (from WordPress root):"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:133
msgid "Sube el archivo .zip a esa carpeta"
msgstr "Upload the .zip file to that folder"

#: includes/admin/views/page-restore.php:134
msgid ""
"Copia o arrastra el archivo .zip de respaldo directamente dentro de esa "
"carpeta. No es necesario descomprimirlo."
msgstr ""
